      "writtenOn": "2026-07-14T08:25:59Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Forwarded: for\u003d192.0.2.60;proto\u003dhttps, for\u003d203.0.113.43;proto\u003dhttp;by\u003d10.0.0.1\n\nTo resolve NETCONF-1648 (\"OpenAPI: Wrong scheme behind proxy\"), where OpenDaylight (ODL) is running behind a proxy and serving OpenAPI (Swagger UI) definitions, you must use the leftmost proto value, which is https.",
      "revId": "4e2d07c5e4484b8671ffef90eb16ae83a177be0e",
